                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} A
          %h3#types_equivalent_to_the_circle_type Types equivalent to the circle type
          %p The circle type is equivalent to the following types
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                The
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/suspension+type"} suspension type
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
