          %h3#induction_principle_without_heterogeneous_identifications Induction principle without heterogeneous identifications
          %p
            There is a version of the induction principle which uses a type
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
